    "innovation": "Using a general circulation model, this paper demonstrates that single-hemisphere solar geoengineering asymmetrically modulates North Atlantic tropical cyclone frequency, with southern hemisphere application enhancing it and northern hemisphere application suppressing it relative to a global application, highlighting risks associated with unilateral deployment.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
